    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Generates one curve per site by averaging the activity of the voxel where
    the site is located together with its n neighboring voxels (user-defined).


    <b>Note</b>:
    This computation grows exponentially with n, and large values can result in very
    long processing times.'
